    "physical_description": "Sarong of cotton woven in yellow, red, black and white. Woven on a hand-loom (kain lurih). The field has a check design of dark and light grey stripes and white spots on a yellow ground. At one end is the kapala figured with light and dark brown stripes crossed by green stripes and white spots. Down each side of the field is a border of red and brown stripes, and along the sides of the kapala is a red border.",
